<% content_for :title, "Guide" %>
<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 md:px-8">
  <p class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-algae-900 dark:text-algae-300">Field guide</p>
  <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Run your first outreach weekend.</h1>
  <div class="mt-6 space-y-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#3d4742] dark:text-[#C6CFC9]">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#D9DDE0] bg-white p-6 dark:bg-[#131B17] dark:border-white/10">
      <p class="font-display font-semibold text-[#1c2420] dark:text-[#E7ECE9]">Saturday — invite</p>
      <p class="mt-1">Add every person you meet with one line of context. Tag first-timers so Sunday's list builds itself.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#D9DDE0] bg-white p-6 dark:bg-[#131B17] dark:border-white/10">
      <p class="font-display font-semibold text-[#1c2420] dark:text-[#E7ECE9]">Sunday — welcome</p>
      <p class="mt-1">Open the event, check guests in at the door. Marking “attended” queues Monday's follow-ups automatically.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#D9DDE0] bg-white p-6 dark:bg-[#131B17] dark:border-white/10">
      <p class="font-display font-semibold text-[#1c2420] dark:text-[#E7ECE9]">Monday — keep</p>
      <p class="mt-1">Each volunteer opens their short list, makes the call, and logs what happened. Nothing lives in anyone's head.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
